# PO governance (Dashboard)

## Activation

Full rules apply when a campaign/wave has a **PO-signed preplan/charter** and `authorized_box` / DoD in `Documents/1-Sprints/`. Research-only drafts (`0 - Documents/**`, `Documents/0-Draft/**`) do not activate autonomy-to-PO messaging.

## One-liner

PO sets Rules + product goals + signed cap. Team runs **one arc** to SUCCESS or CEILING under **strategy as adversarial PO-proxy**. Message PO-human only for: Success Packet · Ceiling Packet · PO Visual after QA PASS · signed **scope** checkpoint (bar / KPI definition / product envelope — not technical phase ack).

## Always enforce (even pre-campaign)

- **Visual first.** Lighthouse / TTI / FPS / bundle size are telemetry until 10-foot visual PASS (no-scroll @1080p, font ≥18px, KPI đọc được từ 3 m).
- **KPI honesty.** Số trên widget phải khớp công thức BFF + nguồn CDE/ERP đã ghi. Mock ≠ product.
- Label evidence scope; smoke ≠ binding gate.
- No diagnostic churn; no Option-tick escalations to PO.
- Weak measurement / Product Evidence mismatch → strategy `REJECT_AND_DIRECT` or `HOLD_MEASURE` — **not** a PO packet.

## Do not message PO for

QA FAIL · ETL/pipeline · Option A/B/C · harness rem · “ack Lx→Ly” · dump logs · perf claims before visual.

Escalate those via `@multi-agents` strategy PO-proxy → technical loop — not PO-human packets.

## Telegram (khi gửi PO)

Tin **ngắn, tiếng Việt**: `Kết quả` + `PO cần` (+ path `Chi tiết`). Chỉ sau `STRATEGY_PO_PACKET`. Không dump log / jargon. Script notify chưa có trong repo này — gửi tay hoặc thêm script khi PO yêu cầu.
